  "title": "Ph Insurance Faqs Objections — FAQ 4: What riders can I attach to my life insurance policy?",
  "content": "### FAQ 4: What riders can I attach to my life insurance policy?\n- **Answer**: You can attach optional riders such as the Critical Illness Benefit (CIB covering 36 critical illnesses like cancer and heart attack), Accidental Death & Dismemberment (ADB), Waiver of Premium upon Disability (WP), and Daily Hospital Income Benefit (HIR).",
